---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const chapters = [
  ['contingency', 'Contingency and dependence', 'What explains the existence of something that could have been absent?'],
  ['necessity', 'A necessary foundation', 'Can dependent things together account for their own existence?'],
  ['mind', 'A mental foundation', 'What could explain the actuality of one possibility among several?'],
  ['conclusion', 'The final conclusion', 'Which claims about the foundation follow from the premises?'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <meta name="description" content="Follow an argument from contingent existence to a necessary mental foundation, and examine the objections at each step." />
  <title>The Contingency Argument · X to G</title>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header><a class="mark" href={base + '/'} aria-label="X to G home">X <i>to</i> G</a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="#chapters">Chapters</a><a href={base + '/examination/objections/'}>Objections</a><a href={base + '/glossary/'}>Glossary</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="opening"><div><h1>The Contingency<br/><em>Argument</em></h1>
      <p>Why does something exist when it could have failed to exist? Follow the argument from this question to a necessary mental foundation.</p>
      <a class="start" href={base + '/overview/'}>Start reading</a>
    </div><figure>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="caption">
        <defs><pattern id="hatch" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="5" height="5"><path d="M0 5 5 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".7"/></pattern></defs>
        <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="200" cy="140" r="116" stroke-dasharray="2 5"/><circle cx="200" cy="140" r="98"/><circle cx="200" cy="140" r="85" stroke-width=".5"/>
        <path d="M200 42 285 189H115Z" fill="url(#hatch)"/><path d="M200 238 115 91H285Z"/><path d="M55 140H345M200 16V264" stroke-dasharray="3 5"/>
        <circle cx="200" cy="140" r="49"/><circle cx="200" cy="140" r="4" fill="currentColor"/></g>
      </svg><figcaption id="caption">Can a ground be found within what depends on it?</figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section id="chapters"><h2>Read the argument</h2><ol>{chapters.map(([slug, title, question], i) => <li><a href={base + '/argument/' + slug + '/'}><span class="numeral">{['I','II','III','IV'][i]}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{question}</p></div></a></li>)}</ol></section>
  </main><footer><span>X to G</span><a href={base + '/examination/sources/'}>Sources and further reading</a></footer>
</body></html>
<style>
  :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}
  :global(html){background:#f7f6ef;color:#192e2a;font:100%/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}
  body{max-width:80rem;margin:auto;padding:0 clamp(1.2rem,5vw,5rem)}
  a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:.24em}
  a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ab5230;outline-offset:4px}
  .skip{position:absolute;top:-5rem;background:white;padding:.6rem}.skip:focus{top:.3rem}
  header,footer,nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:clamp(.75rem,3vw,2rem);flex-wrap:wrap}
  header{min-height:5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #99aaa0}.mark{font:bold 1.7rem Georgia,serif;text-decoration:none}.mark i{font-weight:400;color:#88512d}
  nav a,footer a{font-size:.9rem}nav a{text-decoration:none}nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  .opening{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:2rem;padding:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem) 0}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;margin:0;line-height:1.06}
  h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7.5vw,7rem);letter-spacing:-.06em}h1 em{color:#316449;font-weight:400}
  .opening p{max-width:35rem;font-size:1.13rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
  .start{display:inline-block;background:#214b3e;color:white;padding:.67rem 1.35rem;text-decoration:none;border-radius:.25rem}
  .start:hover{background:#316449}figure{margin:0;text-align:center;color:#36644f}svg{width:min(100%,27rem)}figcaption{font:italic 1rem/1.5 Georgia,serif}
  #chapters{border-top:1px solid #99aaa0;padding:2.2rem 0}h2{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:3rem}
  li{border-bottom:1px solid #c6cec4}li a{display:flex;gap:1.3rem;padding:1.5rem .3rem;text-decoration:none}li a:hover h3{text-decoration:underline}
  .numeral{font:italic 1.25rem Georgia,serif;color:#7c4a29;min-width:2rem}h3{font-size:1.4rem}li p{margin:.5rem 0 0;color:#42584e}
  footer{border-top:1px solid #99aaa0;padding:1.25rem 0 2rem}
  @media(max-width:43rem){.opening,ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.opening{gap:1rem}figure svg{max-height:11rem}header{padding:.8rem 0}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){:global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth}.opening{animation:arrive .45s ease-out}.start{transition:background .16s}@keyframes arrive{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(.4rem)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}}
</style>
